  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material expressing online disapproval",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the textual material 'I don't like this post' because the meme uses this phrase as the trigger for the violent response. The user is not explicitly addressed with 'you' or 'me', but the entire meme structure (text + image) frames the user as the one who might feel the urge to 'gas it' in response to disliking content, making the user the implied subject of the action. The projection is onto the text_chunk entity, which represents the user's potential online behavior.",
